#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:19
msgid "Open every square without a mine. A number tells how many of the eight squares around it hide mines. The first square you open is always safe. Three sizes; best times are kept."
msgstr "打開每個沒有地雷的方格。一個數字顯示它周圍的八個方格中有多少個埋有地雷。你打開的第一個方塊總是安全的。三種尺寸；最好的時光被保留。"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:20
msgid "click opens  ·  right-click flags  ·  click a number with its flags placed to open around it  ·  arrows, Space, F"
msgstr "點選開啟 · 右鍵點選標誌 · 點選一個數字及其周圍放置的標誌以開啟 · 箭頭、空格、F"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:22
#: config/apps/io.github.lyricat.Inua.SpacePinball.desktop:3
msgid "Space Pinball"
msgstr "太空彈珠"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:23
msgid "Fly missions to climb the ranks, from Cadet to Fleet Admiral. Hit the three yellow mission targets to light a mission, then shoot the launch ramp (right) to accept it; the display shows what to shoot and the time left. Missions burn fuel: roll through the inlanes and the re-entry lanes to refuel. The hyperspace ramp (left) climbs five levels, lighting an extra ball at the third and paying a jackpot at the fifth. The booster bank lights Lock: lock two balls in the black hole for multiball, where the launch ramp is the jackpot. The wormhole lets the ball out of the black hole. Light all three re-entry lanes to raise the field multiplier. The plunger's pull picks the lane a launch drops into: hit the blinking one for the skill shot. Nudge to save a ball, but not too often: the table tilts. Three balls; your best score is kept."
msgstr "執行飛行任務以提升軍銜，從學員到海軍上將。擊中三個黃色任務目標即可點燃任務，然後射擊發射坡道（右）以接受任務；顯示器顯示要拍攝的內容和剩餘時間。任務燃燒燃料：穿過內航道和再入航道補充燃料。超空間坡道（左）爬升五層，在第三層額外點亮一個球，並在第五層支付大獎。助推器組燈鎖定：將兩個球鎖定在黑洞中以獲得多球，其中發射坡道就是大獎。蟲洞讓球離開黑洞。點亮所有三個重返通道以提高場倍增器。柱塞的拉力會選擇發射所進入的車道：擊中閃爍的車道即可進行技能射擊。輕推以保存球，但不要太頻繁：桌子會傾斜。三個球；您的最佳成績將被保留。"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:24
msgid "A or ← left flipper  ·  D or → right flipper  ·  hold Space to pull the plunger  ·  X . ↑ nudge  ·  M sound  ·  P pause  ·  N new game"
msgstr "A或←左鰭狀件·D或→右鰭狀件·保持空間以拉動柱塞·X。 ↑ 輕推·M 聲音·P 暫停·N 新遊戲"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:26
#: config/apps/io.github.lyricat.Inua.SmallFortune.desktop:3
msgid "Small Fortune"
msgstr "小小富翁"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:27
msgid "A property game against one to three computer players on a ring of 40 squares with two branch roads (at a fork, chance picks the road), in Tokyo, New York, Shanghai or Rome: choose the city, the rounds, the starting money, your rivals and the rules (one die or two; building on a street the turn you buy it) before you start. Roll the dice and walk the board; with two, a double rolls again and three in a row go to jail. Buy the streets, ferry piers and utilities you land on; rivals landing there pay you rent. Every street of yours your pawn passes or lands on may go up one level that turn (outlined on the board): house by house to four, then a hotel; owning a whole colour group doubles its bare rent and adds half to its built rents. Piers pay more the more of them you own; utilities charge by the dice. Passing Start pays $200. Taxes and fines fill the fountain, and whoever lands there takes it. Who cannot pay sells buildings and property at half price, or is out. After the last round, or when one player is left, the most worth wins: cash, property and buildings. Keys: Space the main action, R roll, B buy, X pass, E end turn, J pay bail, H build on the square in focus, N a new game."
msgstr "在東京、紐約、上海或羅馬，在具有兩條分支路（在岔路口，機會選擇道路）的40個方格的環上對一到三名計算機玩家進行財產遊戲：在開始之前選擇城市、回合、起始資金、你的對手和規則（一兩個骰子；在你購買的回合中在街道上建造）。擲骰子走棋盤；如果有兩個，則再次擲雙骰，並且連續擲出三個將入獄。購買您登陸的街道、渡輪碼頭和公用設施；登陸那裡的競爭對手付你租金。你的棋子經過或降落的每條街道都可能會上升一層（在棋盤上概述）：逐家到四家，然後是一家酒店；擁有整個色彩組，其裸租金將增加一倍，建成租金將增加一半。你擁有的越多，碼頭支付的費用就越多；公用事業按骰子收費。透過開始支付 200 美元。稅金和罰款填滿了噴泉，誰登陸那裡就拿走它。無力支付的人將以半價出售建築物和財產，否則就會被淘汰。最後一輪結束後，或只剩下一名玩家時，最有價值的人獲勝：現金、財產和建築物。按鍵：空間主要行動，R滾動，B購買，X通過，E結束轉彎，J支付保釋金，H在焦點廣場上建造，N新遊戲。"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:28
msgid "Space the main action  ·  R roll  ·  B buy  ·  X pass  ·  E end turn  ·  J pay bail  ·  H build on the square in focus  ·  N new game  ·  click a square to see it"
msgstr "空間主要動作 · R 滾動 · B 購買 · X 通行證 · E 結束回合 · J 支付保釋金 · H 在焦點廣場上建造 · N 新遊戲 · 點擊一個方塊查看它"

